      "quote": "No person may demonstrate within 100 feet of the entrance of a house of worship during scheduled religious services.",
      "mechanism": "Restricts speech by banning demonstrations within a specific distance of a house of worship during certain times.",
      "certainty": "stated"
    },
    {
